[ 274 ]
Func<TSource, TResult> body)
{
object result = null;
Parallel.ForEach(source, (item, loopState) =>
{
result = body(item);
loopState.Stop();
});
return (TResult)result;
}
The following code uses two different logics to calculate the square of 5. We will pass both
approaches to the SpeculativeInvoke method and print the result as soon as possible:
